				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pituita in gulā cohaerescens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					24, 15, 80, § 130</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">20, 16, 64,
				§ 172</span></i>.</div>
